WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:12.230
11. Self-Generated Energy. Imagine a world without batteries or chargers.

2
00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:18.310
What if you could power your electronic devices just by moving around? It's not as crazy as

3
00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:25.550
it sounds. Movement creates energy, and people move all the time. The trick is to collect

4
00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:33.030
that energy and direct it. The idea of creating energy with movement isn't new. Many objects

5
00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:39.590
in the past and the present are charged with cranks, radios, flashlights, or even phone

6
00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:44.870
chargers. You turn the crank for a certain amount of time, and enough energy is created

7
00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:52.750
to power the device. The newest idea is a bit different and a bit more difficult. Instead

8
00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:58.770
of using a specific movement, turning a crank, the idea is to catch and use the energy we

9
00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:05.090
create with our regular movements in our daily life. One way to get this energy is

10
00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:12.210
with an energy harvester designed by Max Donilon. The device fits behind your knee and connects

11
00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:18.290
to the leg muscles. When you walk and move your knee, the movement turns small gears,

12
00:01:18.290 --> 00:01:24.170
which send energy to a generator. The energy could then be used to charge batteries or

13
00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:31.570
even power artificial joints. Another object uses energy from walking in a different way.

14
00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:38.010
The e-bag is a snack cooler. You swing the bag as you carry it. The handle collects the

15
00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:45.530
energy from the swinging motion and uses it to cool the food inside. Some objects have

16
00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:52.090
to be moved to be used. It makes sense to use the energy from moving them to power them,

17
00:01:52.330 --> 00:02:00.130
that's the idea behind a new kinetic mouse. Moving the mouse keeps it powered. Self-generated

18
00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:06.530
and kinetic energy uses are still being developed. As people try to be cleaner and greener,

19
00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:11.170
we can expect to see more objects that depend on our bodies for power.
